  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U77Xv%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-J343ebAR%5C%22%3E2024%E5%B9%B411%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E8%90%A5%E9%94%80%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%88%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%3Cstrong%3E%E3%80%8C%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E4%B8%8E%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E3%80%8D%3C%2Fstrong%3E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AC%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%E5%B0%86%E7%BB%93%E5%90%88%E6%9C%AC%E6%AC%A1%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8EAPI%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E6%94%B9%E5%8A%A8%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-SvQDjZv3%5C%22%3E%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E8%90%A5%E9%94%80%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%81%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fhelp_center%2Fcontent%2F143140%3FspaceId%3D195%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8Bhttps%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fhelp_center%2Fcontent%2F143140%3FspaceId%3D195%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-J343ebAR\">2024年11月，巨量营销升级版针对<strong>「推广产品与目标」</strong>模块进行升级，本文档将结合本次更新说明API相关改动</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-SvQDjZv3\">巨量营销平台升级说明详见：<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/help_center/content/143140?spaceId=195\" target=\"_blank\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/help_center/content/143140?spaceId=195</a></p></div></div></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-3WRQXQKR\" id=\"h346b9f0-3WRQXQKR\">一、 概念说明</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-LnVH9D81\"><br></p><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-GIYLKM47\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Y403GC9V\"><strong>营销产品：</strong>即客户在巨量引擎投放的对象,对于电商行业业可能是某件衣服,下载行业可能是某个App或者小程序,网服行业可能是某部小说,线索行业可能是婚纱摄影影套餐/培训课程服务等。</li></ul><p data-id=\"p0e47204-PDc8CA7J\" style=\"text-indent: 2em;\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/7fbf5ae0576c4b2bbc89d58c3850c8d1~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2046834062&amp;x-signature=SyF8TZa5MRNknu9ndv6EG%2Fe0mnE%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-pSarDdRV\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-DoCD2Dxx\"><strong>商品</strong>：</li></ul><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-p2P4oS4h\" data-indent=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cWZOfbWJ\">由商品库（原行业产品中心）来承载营销产品的表达包含非下载行业（如教育/金融）和少部分下载行业（如小说/短剧）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5mMIxY7S\">客户可以在工作台的商品库（原行业产品中心）创建商品（原产品）并在投放时使用</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XIANkSPc\">特别说明:对于部分投放账户，因其他项目要求必须关联关商品进行投放的（如使用ubmax、医疗机构、医疗器械等行业客户）在投放产品模块仅支持选择「商品」选项</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-kcy9vO6H\"><br></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-tjcD2zhV\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-xHxdXMFr\"><strong>投放载体</strong></li></ul><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-5OwxakFA\" data-indent=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WJTGysjC\">「投放载体」是客户使用「商品」投放时增加的选项。因营销产品中的「商品」无法直接投放，需关联对应载体才可以完成投放诉求的表达，这个投放载体在应用场景下可能是某个APP，在小程序场景下可能是某个小程序或小游戏，在原生场景下可能是抖音号或落地页。</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-pTh0czsc\"><br></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-J0amJAIn\" id=\"h346b9f0-J0amJAIn\">二、 API创编主要变化及影响</h1><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ACEet%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-utOm78gw%5C%22%3E%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8B%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E7%9A%84%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E4%BC%A0%E5%8F%82%E6%94%B9%E5%8A%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%81%E6%AD%A4%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%EF%BC%9A%E3%80%8C%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fbytedance.larkoffice.com%2Fdocx%2FUkVHd5Ne4onfGsxHsF4cO4xcnis%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E3%80%90%E7%BB%88%E7%89%88%E3%80%91%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E4%B8%8E%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7-Marketing%20API%E6%94%B9%E5%8A%A8%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%E3%80%8D%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-utOm78gw\">每个推广目的下涉及的接口传参改动，可详见此文档：「<a href=\"https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/docx/UkVHd5Ne4onfGsxHsF4cO4xcnis\" target=\"_blank\">【终版】推广产品与目标升级-Marketing API改动</a>」</p></div></div></div><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-pn1PZbW9\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-rQjaiAfW\"><col data-id=\"c81c0dfc-97VAYBZm\" span=\"1\" width=\"27.790432801822323%\"><col data-id=\"c51316be-9JdE3DVG\" span=\"1\" width=\"49.202733485193626%\"><col data-id=\"cb1dbd81-7JeXY5SD\" span=\"1\" width=\"23.006833712984054%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-jjrnEp4b\"><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-skZ8opGR\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-XWKuBrvr\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KerPReC5\">巨量营销升级版PC端改动内容</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-Dwi8Ev3Z\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-W71i4zHr\">对API使用的主要影响</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-BJ9BCiAS\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EKnDxNxW\">是否兼容？</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-BXlkKxSW\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-kuxVn2oJ\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-lNOhIffP\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jVQZzF5G\">「关联产品」、「投放内容与目标」融合为<span style=\"color: #245bdb;\"><strong>「营销产品与目标」</strong></span></li></ul></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-nEX2QTZM\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-3tga6JFB\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6TbqtkZg\">获取项目列表接口新增获取“营销产品”、“投放载体”字段，便于您了解API参数设置与PC端设置的对应关系</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Tzdb0cuU\">创建项目接口改动较小，可详见本文档第三部分</li></ul></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-UZ25cw5t\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9kJpL2Na\">不涉及兼容</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-NPWsBemT\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-iko3riUS\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-S2wiP9Rw\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-eXmvh9TZ\">「应用调起-直达链接」填写位置变更<span style=\"color: #245bdb;\"><em>(仅应用营销目的)</em></span></li></ul></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-rANzIkLA\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fq7CqzDr\"><strong>Before</strong>：直达链接&amp;备用直达链接在<strong>创建项目</strong>时填写</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-nVLIBj2c\"><strong>After</strong>：直达链接&amp;备用直达链接只能在<span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">创建营销</span>时填写</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-TbnxBv8y\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2H8mh8Yg\">✅ 预计24年12月10日起该场景下，禁止在项目层级传入直达链接</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-m7DnAVXq\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-Cu7BBsIl\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-jVXGr3bP\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pZp6zFEA\">「内容营销-投放产品=抖音号」抖音号填写位置变更<span style=\"color: #245bdb;\"><em>（仅内容营销营销目的）</em></span></li></ul></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-Dt5xX2Pd\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sba2sFfo\"><strong>Before</strong>：如投放内容为抖音主页或直播场景，需在单元层级填写抖音号信息</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-yNmVrBEe\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-3tAIHNB4\"><strong>After</strong>：满足以下条件时，可在项目层级设置抖音号ID</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-9QyaJr1d\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6xtZdqyO\">内容营销-通投-不投商品，可投放抖音号（非必须）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ghBmw8Q1\">内容营销-搜索，必须在项目层级设置抖音号</li></ul></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-CSR0DTDc\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bTXpVYn0\">✅ 预计24年12月10日起，左侧在项目层级必填抖音号ID场景生效</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-YDqd3ZeD\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-QX6jdxKQ\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-iRSybVaO\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-TQHnsFKI\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-87G1SJ6Q\">服务全面资产化,「微信小程序&amp;微信小游戏投放」在项目中明确投放具体资产ID</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-M9MC7MAW\"><br></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-9f5GrQQv\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-D8Gx14pz\"><strong>Before</strong>：投放微信小程序/小游戏时，无需设置小程序资产id（micro_app_instance_id）</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-JyMEhlxh\"><strong>After</strong>：投放微信小程序/小游戏时，<span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">必须设置</span>小程序资产id（micro_app_instance_id）</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-y32eQr5Y\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GnQ2X6oG\">✅ 预计24年12月10日起该场景下，微信小程序/小游戏资产id必填</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-vRFvUclF\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-IbA6DnFn\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taa552b2-LrH9YdSM\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-QoPdfTG7\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-S5kVi05S\">「字节小程序」投放，不再支持设置备用事件资产<span style=\"color: #245bdb;\"><em>（不限营销目的）</em></span></li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-uhaPjuRn\"><br></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taa552b2-K06cQTdj\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-c9JaNwob\"><strong>Before</strong>：投放字节小程序时，创建项目时事件资产id（optimize_goal.asset_ids）可设置2个，第2个代表备用事件资产</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-3FTo0tN1\"><strong>After</strong>：投放字节小程序时，创建项目时事件资产id（optimize_goal.asset_ids）只能设置1个，不再支持备用事件资产</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ci7WRgfP\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-8FPRDzaJ\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\">注意</span>：该逻辑不区分营销目的，目前小程序、电商、销售线索营销目的下均可投放字节小程序，这些场景下都将不再支持设置备用事件资产</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t1c6b3a2-hqn42iTC\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-THXSqIs6\">✅ 预计24年12月10日起该场景下，optimize_goal.asset_ids传入2个id会报错</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-vd1tp11f\"><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p0e47204-WGAso0YS\" style=\"text-indent: 2em;\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-03HJ9X6R\"><br></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-AL75gZGN\" id=\"h346b9f0-AL75gZGN\">三、&nbsp;Marketing API新建项目如何表达营销产品/投放载体</h1><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vqXpD%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-GKiTiXxT%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-N9aESNTk%5C%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E6%AC%A1%E9%9C%80%E6%B1%82MAPI%E5%88%9B%E7%BC%96%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22color%3A%20%23f5222d%3B%5C%22%3E%E6%9E%81%E5%B0%8F%3C%2Fspan%3E%EF%BC%8CAPI%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22color%3A%20%23f5222d%3B%5C%22%3E%E6%9A%82%E6%9C%AA%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%3C%2Fspan%3E%E2%80%9C%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E2%80%9D%E3%80%81%E2%80%9C%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E8%BD%BD%E4%BD%93%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%E5%AD%97%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%8C%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22color%3A%20%232f54eb%3B%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3E%E5%8F%AA%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%B7%B2%E6%9C%89%E5%AD%97%E6%AE%B5%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E5%88%B0PC%E7%AB%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E3%80%81%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E8%BD%BD%E4%BD%93%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E3%80%82%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-7ULmQJEb%5C%22%3E%E4%BD%86%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E6%82%A8%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%88%9B%E7%BC%96%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8EAD%20PC%E7%AB%AF%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%2F%E8%BD%BD%E4%BD%93%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E8%A1%A8%EF%BC%9A%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-GKiTiXxT\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-N9aESNTk\">本次需求MAPI创编接口逻辑变化<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">极小</span>，API创建项目<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">暂未新增</span>“推广产品”、“投放载体”专用字段，<span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\"><strong>只需要使用接口已有字段</strong></span>，即可完成对应到PC端的推广产品、投放载体设置。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7ULmQJEb\">但如果您需要理解创编接口参数与AD PC端投放产品/载体概念的关联逻辑，可参考下表：</li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-bZP4PjbT\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-aG8gBX10\"><col data-id=\"c59c1865-PioA5dE9\" span=\"1\" width=\"5.0113895216400905%\"><col data-id=\"cfb7c2c0-nATGU9O5\" span=\"1\" width=\"39.40774487471526%\"><col data-id=\"c66fb840-fcfSfITX\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.25740318906606%\"><col data-id=\"cc158bb7-UhQm1jWQ\" span=\"1\" width=\"22.323462414578586%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-OoqqWd7T\"><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-2Aq6A2tD\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-S7kf72SC\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-udlpdtDa\">营销目的</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-lBQTlOxG\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7uTJMwPA\">营销产品（创建项目API设置项，变动用<span style=\"color: #d83931;\">红字</span>标出)</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-lFd199RA\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TqJA6dvd\">投放载体（创建项目API设置项，变动用<span style=\"color: #d83931;\">红字</span>标出)</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-mUvevq1H\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wnVbghvR\">上线后针对营销产品/投放载体的表达，API创建项目接口逻辑变化</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-YAaSg0Nk\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-GpeffzeF\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6VAqmmvE\">应用</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-gRQ7IXyI\"><br></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-s0MIo2Bu\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-TPUoc9HZ\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HdzHxoMG\"><strong>应用</strong>：选择app_promotion_type （子目标：如应用调起/预约/下载）且项目层级<u>不传</u>related_product结构体</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-5onoJHqi\"><br></p><ol data-id=\"oa950d4e-gTqHjRj7\" start=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-q38FW7IM\"><strong>商品</strong>：项目层级<u>传入</u>related_product结构体设置项目绑定哪些商品，则表示投放产品=商品</li></ol></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-QERJrmHM\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-gJBR6Krr\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-OudvFYBP\">仅当营销产品=商品时，AD PC端会出现载体选项且只有应用，此场景传参要求同左侧</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-XlrAGwsM\"><br></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-iwSn7RS9\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-F8HjLYhB\">不变</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-7NsubcIj\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-I2YzqG6f\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-yWv1Hj0Y\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2yHcrzpH\">小程序</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-LMaWyAvT\"><br></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-CmuPjQLC\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-SrykO1P8\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cbnD27mc\"><strong>字节小程序</strong>：micro_promotion_type = BYTE_APP 且<span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>需要传入micro_app_instance_id（不传会报错）</strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bQ4FQhf7\"><strong>微信小程序</strong>：micro_promotion_type = WECHAT_APP且<span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>需要传入micro_app_instance_id（预计12月10日后不传入会报错）</strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ovWr42tF\"><strong>字节小游戏</strong>：micro_promotion_type = BYTE_GAME且<span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>需要传入micro_app_instance_id（不传会报错）</strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VhcAb4C9\"><strong>微信小游戏：</strong>micro_promotion_type = WECHAT_GAME<span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>需要传入micro_app_instance_id（预计12月10日</strong></span><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>后不传入会报错）</strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pQMfi19K\"><strong>抖音号</strong>：micro_promotion_type = AWEME</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5nhruR1n\"><strong>商品</strong>：项目层级传入related_product结构体设置项目绑定哪些商品，则表示营销产品=商品</li></ol></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-DU9LqfPY\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Hbk9GReE\">仅当营销产品=商品时，AD PC端会出现载体选项：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Tu2yLx06\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Fr4oTdwP\"><strong>字节小程序</strong>：此场景传参要求同左侧</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0WWFL5d6\"><strong>微信小程序</strong>：此场景传参要求同左侧</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pc7F4uSe\"><strong>抖音号</strong>：此场景传参要求同左侧</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-vioyJ3UE\"><br></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-dk4padFs\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-rUxujSUv\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0TPj2Div\">营销产品/投放载体 为字节小程序/小游戏时，24年<br><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">11月12日</span>起必须传入资产id，否则会报错</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uVPtLGL7\">先前未绑定字节小程序资产的项目下，营销支持编辑，先前项目下不建议新建营销</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VXudRikL\">投放产品/载体 为微信小程序/小游戏时，24年<br><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">12月10日</span>后API创建项目未绑定资产会报错</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3dBmUt0P\">其余逻辑不变</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-dTuh3ou6\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-QWa2owzu\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-l2WWoUkz\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NVAf5R9y\">快应用</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Xdhck9Te\"><br></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-1nB2TXPJ\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-3ycfIDKM\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ol4g2ZfU\"><strong>快应用</strong>：设置quick_app_id快应用资产id且项目层级<u>不传</u>related_product结构体</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3t9KHPRd\"><strong>商品</strong>：项目层级<u>传入</u>related_product结构体设置项目绑定哪些商品，则表示营销产品=商品</li></ol></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-pHPFDxSQ\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Pca7u454\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-veYCIkxw\">仅当营销产品=商品时，AD PC端会出现载体选项且只有快应用，此场景传参要求同左侧</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-RMOjruXf\"><br></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-5qLkhgLO\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-c9v2tSuu\">不变</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-X5iB6CQH\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-HKnECeQL\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WZxgEzqv\">线索</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-sdjCCiWd\"><br></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-oQDNn6h5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-JFMQXfzf\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6C0rxfrU\"><strong>商品</strong>：项目层级可以传入related_product结构体设置项目绑定哪些商品，则表示营销产品=商品，<u>也可不传表示不启用</u></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-I8hOyrUx\"><strong>无产品</strong>：项目层级不添加商品，<u>不传</u>related_product结构体</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-nnrvVzIN\"><br></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-olrSXkge\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QV6cNntv\">不管绑不绑定商品，都需要选择投放载体</p><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-5qzH3RAW\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2OQm2w0w\">橙子落地页：asset_type =ORANGE</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HUq9e8OA\">自研落地页：asset_type =THIRDPARTY</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-x8GMr8OD\">抖音号：asset_type =AWEME</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TwUTuMkC\">企业号落地页：asset_type =ENTERPRISE</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-MXvzBDKt\">字节小程序：asset_type =MICRO_APP且<span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>需要传入micro_app_instance_id（不传会报错）</strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-f2eEc6K2\">微信小程序：asset_type =WECHAT_APPLET且<span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>需要传入micro_app_instance_id（不传会报错）</strong></span></li></ol></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-06oPPvvo\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-0m2X6S5c\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cCmppvWY\">投放载体 为字节小程序时，24年<br><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">11月12日后</span>必须传入资产id，否则会报错</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-sebwUlSs\">存量未绑定字节小程序资产的项目下，营销支持编辑，项目下不建议新建营销</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-CMsT6At6\">营销产品/投放载体 为微信小程序时，<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">预计</span>24年<br><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">12月10日</span>后API创建项目未绑定资产会报错</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3VSm157Q\">其余逻辑不变</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-D6U5AnN9\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-54BG1XSB\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JEzT37S9\">电商</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-heFa1Kqy\"><br></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-IOcO3CkX\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-MWZI9TrP\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ez3JxfTK\"><strong>商品</strong>：项目层级可以传入related_product结构体设置项目绑定哪些商品，则表示营销产品=商品，<u>也可不传表示不启用</u></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-q7gJd7cP\"><strong>无产品</strong>：项目层级不添加商品，<u>不传</u>related_product结构体</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-6RDoNIbd\"><br></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tcaab6a0-OgsrXUFS\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AHdBth7d\">不管绑不绑定商品，都需要选择投放载体</p><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-QOvx8g4V\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-V6SyMa5k\">橙子落地页：asset_type =ORANGE</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0aDD8Y7f\">自研落地页：asset_type =THIRDPARTY</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-MAFpbWwy\">字节小程序：asset_type =MICRO_APP且<span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>需要传入micro_app_instance_id（不传会报错）</strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-sK2ArcOV\">微信小程序：asset_type =WECHAT_APPLET且<span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>需要传入micro_app_instance_id（预计12月10日后不传入会报错）</strong></span></li></ol></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-7LhPMun7\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-864yzSSG\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YMk7v6VY\">同上</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-5EomVgAd\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taa552b2-mt8gOsJs\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-k1HcscYo\">内容营销</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taa552b2-oQVQnIqY\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-OjiMTzL3\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-I6i8lhQQ\"><strong>抖音号</strong>：在项目层级设置了抖音号id时（native_setting.aweme_id)</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-D8J5xJFq\"><strong>商品</strong>：仅当marketing_goal = VIDEO_AND_IMAGE（短视频/图片）时，项目层级可以传入related_product结构体设置项目绑定哪些商品，则表示营销产品=商品</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-aPwSvh7p\"><strong>无产品</strong>：项目层级不添加商品以及抖音号id</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-u6zZw6fT\"><br></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taa552b2-BXPVwgt5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-grkm7Fut\">仅当营销产品=商品/无产品时，AD PC端会出现载体选项</p><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-KwFazQt2\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-xN8fzflp\">抖音号：promotion_type = AWEME_HOME_PAGE</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BorvOk9f\">橙子落地页：promotion_type = LANDING_PAGE_LINK <span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>且必须传入asset_type  = ORANGE </strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kdxbzO4t\">自研落地页：promotion_type = LANDING_PAGE_LINK <span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>且必须传入asset_type  = THIRDPARTY </strong></span></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-XljrhLOZ\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Aeo6AoTp\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\">注意：当营销产品=抖音号时，无需设置载体，不需要传入promotion_type</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t1c6b3a2-aP6OL0SP\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-c3sfJ0qY\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-eU8RzxGN\">投放载体为橙子落地页/自研落地页时，24年<br><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">11月12日</span>后创建项目必须设置asset_type，表达是投放橙子落地页还是自研落地页</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cJF6E2Je\">存量投放载体 = 落地页的项目支持编辑，也支持在项目下新建营销/编辑营销</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-oxDFDYro\">其余逻辑不变</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-1N5AAsZq\"><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-DYdShzV5\"><br></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-W7YHRhId\" id=\"h346b9f0-W7YHRhId\">FAQ</h1><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-mGIn2Gke\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ikk3Dnb0\"><strong>创编时营销产品的设置不一样,对投放会有影响吗?</strong></li></ol><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-pvOqDlHM\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1JG1nxhY\">您好，本次项目创编页面的升级仅调整创编设置结构，将「关联产品」、「投放内容与目标」两个模块融合为「营销产品与目标」，目的是帮助客户更准确表达投放诉求，不影响营销效果。</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-CJ1bWm6O\"><br></p></div>",
  "doc_type": 1,
  "going_offline": false,
  "is_new": false,
  "path": null,
  "title": "升级版营销产品与目标设置说明"
}
